From: sukanka <su975853527@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 23:30:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Drop Boost.System from exported config

Boost.System is header-only and no longer provides a component package in current Boost releases, so downstream consumers must not request it explicitly.

Generated with the assistance of an AI coding tool.
---
 cmake/IfcOpenShellConfig.cmake.in | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/cmake/IfcOpenShellConfig.cmake.in b/cmake/IfcOpenShellConfig.cmake.in
index 741e4fa2336..f99dd7693ea 100644
--- a/cmake/IfcOpenShellConfig.cmake.in
+++ b/cmake/IfcOpenShellConfig.cmake.in
@@ -28,7 +28,6 @@ if(NOT "${IFCOPENSHELL_BOOST_USE_MULTITHREADED}" STREQUAL "")
     set(Boost_USE_MULTITHREADED ${IFCOPENSHELL_BOOST_USE_MULTITHREADED})
 endif()
 set(Boost_COMPONENTS
-    system
     program_options
     regex
     thread
